# ================================================================
# music.mus — Super Spaceguy Shooter music data
#
# INST  name   vol  h2  h3  gate  [attack]  [options...]
#         a sequenced instrument. Default tone: sine + h2 x 2nd + h3 x 3rd harmonic.
#         options:  DET    sine + a detuned copy (h2 = its level, h3 = detune ratio)
#                   SAW    band-limited sawtooth (h2 >= 1 = harmonic count, default 8)
#                   SQR    band-limited square (h2 >= 1 = highest harmonic, default 15)
#                   A=ms   raised-cosine attack (default 3, minimum 1)
#                   R=ms   raised-cosine release ending at gate-off (default 5, minimum 1)
#                   D=sec  exponential decay time toward the sustain level (default none)
#                   S=lvl  sustain level 0..1 after the decay (default 1)
#         Every note starts and ends at exactly 0 (A/R shrink to fit short notes): no clicks.
# SEQ   name   note dur  note dur ...
#         dur in steps (see CUE div). note: C4, F#3, Bb2, R = rest; note@70 = 70% velocity.
#         +name  appends an earlier SEQ;  +name^-5  appends it transposed down 5 semitones.
# PAD   name   vol  attack  note note note ...   (a sustained sine chord, up to 4 notes)
# DRUM  name   step step ...   K kick  S snare  H hi-hat  T tom  C crash  O open hat  . rest
#         lowercase = a soft hit; letters combine in one step (KH = kick + hat). <= 64 steps.
# CUE   name   bpm  [div]      div = steps per beat (default 4 = 16ths; 6 = triplet grid)
#         XF=ms  crossfade from the playing cue into this one (default 60). Setting the cue
#         already playing does nothing: it keeps playing.
# VOICE inst   seq
# CHORD pad-name
# DRUMS drum-name  [gain]
#
# Sources: title adapts the ostinato of Holst's "Mars" (The Planets, 1914-16; Holst d. 1934);
# boss/boss2/boss3 adapt Grieg's "In the Hall of the Mountain King" (Peer Gynt, 1875; Grieg
# d. 1907); gameover adapts Chopin's funeral march (Sonata No. 2, 1839; Chopin d. 1849). All
# transcribed from the public-domain originals, no modern arrangement. The crawl's bass is the
# title's Mars-style bass line at half tempo. Everything else is original.
# ================================================================

# ================================================================
# CRAWL  (story crawl, and the music from launch until the title: G minor, the Mars bass at
# half tempo). It sits under the narration, so it stays out of the voice's band: bass, sub and
# a low string line below ~300 Hz, a slow soft line two octaves above the voice, a timpani
# pulse with a pickup into each phrase.
# ================================================================
INST cbass    0.046  0.35  0.10  0.92  A=60  R=200
INST csub     0.026  0     0     0.92  A=200 R=300
INST clow     0.016  0.15  0     1.00  A=300 R=400
INST chigh    0.0060 0     0.05  0.95  A=400 R=600

SEQ crawl_bass  G2 8  G2 8  G2 8  D3 8  G2 8  C3 8  C3 8  C3 8  G2 8  Ab2 8  F2 8  F2 8  F2 8  C3 8  D3 8  Bb2 8  Bb2 8  C3 8  D3 8  Eb3 8
SEQ crawl_sub   +crawl_bass^-12
SEQ crawl_low   Bb2 16  D3 16  Eb3 32  C3 16  A2 16  C3 16  D3 16  F2 16  G2 16
SEQ crawl_high  D6 16  F6 16  G6 16  Eb6 32  F6 16  G6 16  D6 16  F6 16  G6 16

PAD gm_pad     0.010  0.00003   G3  Bb3  D4

DRUM crawl_timp t . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . t . t .

CUE crawl  56  XF=1500
VOICE cbass  crawl_bass
VOICE csub   crawl_sub
VOICE clow   crawl_low
VOICE chigh  crawl_high
CHORD gm_pad
DRUMS crawl_timp  0.7

# ================================================================
# EMPEROR  (antagonist reveal, slow Dm arpeggio + sub drone)
# ================================================================
INST arpin    0.06   0.50  0     0.60

SEQ emp_bass    D2 4  F2 4  A2 4  C3 4

PAD dm_pad     0.018  0.00002   D2  F2  A2
PAD dm_drone   0.030  0.00002   D1

CUE emperor  40  XF=1500
VOICE arpin  emp_bass
CHORD dm_pad
CHORD dm_drone

# ================================================================
# TITLE / OPTIONS  (Holst, Mars: the 5/4 col legno ostinato on G, triplet grid)
# 4 bars of ostinato + bass, then 4 bars with the brass line on top (in octaves).
# ================================================================
INST tbass    0.07   0.50  0.25  0.75
INST tcoll    0.026  0     0     0.45  SQR  A=2  R=10  D=0.08  S=0.25
INST tbrass   0.024  0     0     0.92  SAW  A=18 R=40  D=0.6   S=0.75
INST tbrlo    0.018  0     0     0.92  SAW  A=18 R=40  D=0.6   S=0.75

SEQ mars_ost    G3@70 2  G3@70 2  G3@70 2  G3 6  G3 6  G3@80 3  G3@80 3  G3 6
SEQ mars_bass   G2 6  G2 6  G2 6  D3 6  G2 6  C3 6  C3 6  C3 6  G2 6  Ab2 6  F2 6  F2 6  F2 6  C3 6  D3 6  Bb2 6  Bb2 6  C3 6  D3 6  Eb3 6
SEQ mars_brass  G4 18  D5 6  Eb5 6  C5 18  G4 6  Ab4 6  F4 18  C5 6  D5 6  Bb4 12  C5 6  D5 6  Eb5 6
SEQ title_lead  R 120  +mars_brass
SEQ title_low   +title_lead^-12

PAD g5_pad     0.010  0.00003   G3  D4

DRUM title      Tc . t . t . T . . . . . T . . . . . T . . t . . T . . . . .  T . t . t . T . . . . . T . . . . . T . . t . . T . . . . .

CUE title  112  6  XF=1500
VOICE tcoll   mars_ost
VOICE tbass   mars_bass
VOICE tbrass  title_lead
VOICE tbrlo   title_low
CHORD g5_pad
DRUMS title  0.55

# ================================================================
# GAME  (original "Pursuit": E minor chase, 140 BPM, 16 bars)
# Em C D Bm | Em C Am B7 under an A melody (softer) then a busier B melody;
# plucked saw bass in octave 8ths, square counter-line, two-voice string pad.
# ================================================================
INST gbass    0.060  0     0     0.85  SAW  A=2   R=8   D=0.25  S=0.55
INST glead    0.042  0.65  0.004 0.92  DET  A=6   R=20
INST gcount   0.018  0     0     0.95  SQR  A=25  R=60
INST gpad     0.013  0.20  0.05  1.00  A=120 R=150

SEQ gb_e        E2 2  E2@70 2  E3@85 2  E2@70 2  E2@95 2  E2@70 2  E3@85 2  E2@70 2
SEQ gb_b7       B1 2  B1@70 2  B2@85 2  B1@70 2  B1@95 2  B1@70 2  B2@85 2  D#2@80 2
SEQ game_bass   +gb_e  +gb_e^-4  +gb_e^-2  +gb_e^-5  +gb_e  +gb_e^-4  +gb_e^-7  +gb_b7

SEQ game_lead_a B4@85 4  E5@85 4  G5@85 2  F#5@85 2  E5@85 4  E5@85 6  D5@85 2  C5@85 4  G4@85 4  A4@85 4  D5@85 4  F#5@85 2  E5@85 2  D5@85 4  F#5@85 6  E5@85 2  D5@85 4  B4@85 4  B4@85 4  E5@85 4  G5@85 2  A5@85 2  B5@85 4  C6@85 6  B5@85 2  G5@85 4  E5@85 4  A5@85 4  G5@85 2  E5@85 2  C5@85 4  E5@85 4  F#5@85 4  D#5@85 4  B4@85 6  R 2
SEQ game_lead_b E5 2  E5 2  G5 2  E5 2  B5 4  A5 2  G5 2  G5 2  G5 2  E5 2  G5 2  C6 4  B5 2  G5 2  F#5 2  F#5 2  A5 2  F#5 2  D6 4  C6 2  A5 2  B5 6  A5 2  F#5 4  D5 4  E5 2  E5 2  G5 2  E5 2  B5 4  A5 2  G5 2  C6 4  B5 4  G5 4  E5 4  A5 2  B5 2  C6 2  B5 2  A5 4  E5 4  D#5 4  F#5 4  A5 4  B5 4
SEQ game_lead   +game_lead_a  +game_lead_b

SEQ game_count  G4 8  F#4 8  E4 8  G4 8  F#4 8  A4 8  F#4 16  G4 8  B4 8  C5 8  G4 8  A4 8  C5 8  B4 8  A4 8
SEQ game_p1     B3 16  C4 16  A3 16  B3 16  B3 16  C4 16  C4 16  B3 16
SEQ game_p2     E4 16  E4 16  D4 16  D4 16  E4 16  E4 16  E4 16  D#4 16

DRUM game       KC h H h SH h H h KH h KH h SH h H h  KH h H h SH h H h KH h KH h SH h H h  KH h H h SH h H h KH h KH h SH h H h  KH h H h SH h H h KH h T h T t S S

CUE game  140  XF=250
VOICE gbass   game_bass
VOICE glead   game_lead
VOICE gcount  game_count
VOICE gpad    game_p1
VOICE gpad    game_p2
DRUMS game  1.15

# ================================================================
# BOSS  (Grieg, In the Hall of the Mountain King, transposed B minor -> E minor)
# Form A A B A (16 bars). Like the original, each phase is faster and fuller:
#   boss  140  the theme low and staccato over pizzicato bass and a soft heartbeat
#   boss2 158  brass takes the theme an octave up, driving octave bass, strings, backbeat
#   boss3 176  everything at once, plus a semitone string trill and 16th hats
# ================================================================
INST mkbsn    0.070  0     0     0.55  SQR  A=3   R=12
INST mkbrass  0.034  0     0     0.80  SAW  A=6   R=15  D=0.3   S=0.7
INST mkpizz   0.085  0.30  0.10  0.70  A=2   R=20  D=0.12  S=0
INST mkbass   0.040  0     0     0.85  SAW  A=2   R=8   D=0.2   S=0.5
INST mkstr    0.016  0.25  0.08  1.00  A=80  R=120
INST mktril   0.009  0.20  0     0.90  A=3   R=5

SEQ mk_a        E4 2  F#4 2  G4 2  A4 2  B4 2  G4 2  B4 4  A#4 2  F#4 2  A#4 4  A4 2  F4 2  A4 4  E4 2  F#4 2  G4 2  A4 2  B4 2  G4 2  B4 2  E5 2  D5 2  B4 2  G4 2  B4 2  D5 8
SEQ mk_b        B3 2  C#4 2  D#4 2  E4 2  F#4 2  D#4 2  F#4 4  G4 2  D#4 2  G4 4  F#4 2  D#4 2  F#4 4  B3 2  C#4 2  D#4 2  E4 2  F#4 2  D#4 2  F#4 4  G4 2  D#4 2  G4 4  F#4 8
SEQ mk_mel4     +mk_a  +mk_a  +mk_b  +mk_a
SEQ mk_mel5     +mk_mel4^12

SEQ mk_pz_a     E2 4  B1 4  E2 4  B1 4
SEQ mk_pz_b     B1 4  F#2 4  B1 4  F#2 4
SEQ mk_pz       +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a  +mk_pz_b +mk_pz_b +mk_pz_b +mk_pz_b  +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a +mk_pz_a

SEQ mk_b8_a     E2 2  E3@70 2  E2@90 2  E3@70 2  E2@95 2  E3@70 2  E2@90 2  E3@70 2
SEQ mk_b8       +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a  +mk_b8_a^-5 +mk_b8_a^-5 +mk_b8_a^-5 +mk_b8_a^-5  +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a +mk_b8_a

SEQ mk_s1_a     G3 16  F#3 8  F3 8  G3 16  G3 16
SEQ mk_s1_b     F#3 16  G3 8  F#3 8  F#3 16  G3 8  F#3 8
SEQ mk_s1       +mk_s1_a  +mk_s1_a  +mk_s1_b  +mk_s1_a
SEQ mk_s2_a     B3 16  A#3 8  A3 8  B3 16  B3 16
SEQ mk_s2_b     D#4 16  D#4 16  D#4 16  D#4 16
SEQ mk_s2       +mk_s2_a  +mk_s2_a  +mk_s2_b  +mk_s2_a

SEQ mk_tr_a     B5 1  C6 1  B5 1  C6 1  B5 1  C6 1  B5 1  C6 1  B5 1  C6 1  B5 1  C6 1  B5 1  C6 1  B5 1  C6 1
SEQ mk_tr       +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a  +mk_tr_a^-5 +mk_tr_a^-5 +mk_tr_a^-5 +mk_tr_a^-5  +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a +mk_tr_a

DRUM mk1        k . h . k . h . k . h . k . h .  k . h . k . h . k . h . k . h .  k . h . k . h . k . h . k . h .  k . h . k . h . k . h . T . T .
DRUM mk2        KH . H . SH . H . KH . H . SH . H .  KH . H . SH . H . KH . H . SH . H .  KH . H . SH . H . KH . H . SH . H .  KH . H . SH . H . KH . T . T T S S
DRUM mk3        KC h H h SH h H h KH h H K SH h H h  KH h H h SH h H h KH h H K SH h H h  KH h H h SH h H h KH h H K SH h H h  KH h H h SH h H h T T T T S S S S

CUE boss  140
VOICE mkbsn   mk_mel4
VOICE mkpizz  mk_pz
VOICE mkstr   mk_s1
DRUMS mk1  1.2

CUE boss2  158
VOICE mkbrass mk_mel5
VOICE mkbsn   mk_mel4
VOICE mkbass  mk_b8
VOICE mkstr   mk_s1
VOICE mkstr   mk_s2
DRUMS mk2

CUE boss3  176
VOICE mkbrass mk_mel5
VOICE mkbsn   mk_mel4
VOICE mkbass  mk_b8
VOICE mkpizz  mk_pz
VOICE mkstr   mk_s1
VOICE mkstr   mk_s2
VOICE mktril  mk_tr
DRUMS mk3  1.1

# ================================================================
# PLANET  (triumphant arrival, G major: original brass fanfare over timpani)
# ================================================================
INST plbass   0.050  0.50  0.25  0.92  A=10  R=60
INST plbrass  0.030  0     0     0.90  SAW  A=15  R=50  D=0.5  S=0.7

SEQ pln_fan     G4 2  G4 2  G4 2  D5 10  C5 4  B4 4  A4 4  B4 4  G4 2  G4 2  G4 2  D5 6  G5 4  F#5 8  G5 8
SEQ pln_bass    G2 16  C3 16  G2 16  D3 8  G2 8

PAD gmaj_pad   0.022  0.00004   G3  B3  D4

DRUM pln_timp   T . . . . . . . t . . . . . . .

CUE planet  120  XF=400
VOICE plbass   pln_bass
VOICE plbrass  pln_fan
CHORD gmaj_pad
DRUMS pln_timp  0.8

# ================================================================
# ASTEROID  (belt traverse — slow Am drone, building dread)
# ================================================================
INST abass    0.050  0.50  0.25  0.70

SEQ ast_bass  A2 4  R 4  G2 4  R 4  A2 4  F2 4  E2 4  R 4

PAD am_belt   0.020  0.00003  A2  C3  E3
PAD ast_sub   0.028  0.00002  A1

DRUM ast_hh  . . H . . . . H . . H . . . . H

CUE asteroid  70
VOICE abass  ast_bass
CHORD am_belt
CHORD ast_sub
DRUMS ast_hh

# ================================================================
# GAME OVER  (Chopin, funeral march, B-flat minor -> A minor, 60 BPM)
# the melody over the left hand's rocking Am / F-over-A chords and a low A toll
# ================================================================
INST gomel    0.050  0.40  0.15  0.95  A=30  R=80
INST gotoll   0.045  0.30  0.10  0.90  A=8   R=120  D=0.5  S=0.15
INST golh     0.020  0.25  0.05  0.95  A=40  R=100  D=0.8  S=0.5

SEQ go_mel      A3 4  A3 3  A3 1  A3 8  C4 3  B3 1  B3 3  A3 1  A3 3  G#3 1  A3 4  A3 4  A3 3  A3 1  A3 8  C4 3  B3 1  B3 3  A3 1  A3 3  G#3 1  A3 4
SEQ go_toll     A1 4
SEQ go_lh1      E2 4  F2 4
SEQ go_lh2      C3 4

DRUM go_drum    t . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .

CUE gameover  60  XF=600
VOICE gomel   go_mel
VOICE gotoll  go_toll
VOICE golh    go_lh1
VOICE golh    go_lh2
DRUMS go_drum  0.8

# ================================================================
# DOCK  (upgrade dock between stages — relaxed F major hangar loop, 96 BPM)
# Fmaj7 | Dm7 | Bbmaj7 | Gm7 C  -- 4 bars; every voice 64 steps so they stay locked
# ================================================================
INST dlead    0.028  0.30  0.06  0.60  A=12  R=40
INST dbell    0.010  0     0.20  0.85  A=3   R=30  D=0.25  S=0.3

SEQ dock_bass   F2 6  C3 2  F2 4  A2 4  D2 6  A2 2  D3 4  C3 4  Bb1 6  F2 2  Bb2 4  A2 4  G2 6  D3 2  C2 4  E2 4
SEQ dock_lead   R 4  A4 2  C5 2  E5 4  D5 2  C5 2  D5 6  C5 2  A4 4  F4 4  R 4  F4 2  A4 2  D5 4  C5 2  A4 2  Bb4 4  A4 2  G4 2  A4 6  R 2
SEQ dock_arp    F5 2  A5 2  C6 2  E6 2  C6 2  A5 2  F5 2  A5 2  D5 2  F5 2  A5 2  C6 2  A5 2  F5 2  D5 2  F5 2  Bb4 2  D5 2  F5 2  A5 2  F5 2  D5 2  Bb4 2  D5 2  G4 2  Bb4 2  D5 2  F5 2  E5 2  C5 2  Bb4 2  G4 2

PAD fmaj7_pad  0.012  0.00003   F3  A3  C4  E4

DRUM dock_hh    K . H . . . H . K . H . . . H H

CUE dock  96  XF=800
VOICE tbass  dock_bass
VOICE dlead  dock_lead
VOICE dbell  dock_arp
CHORD fmaj7_pad
DRUMS dock_hh
